{"id":67411,"date":"2025-09-27T18:14:25","date_gmt":"2025-09-27T17:14:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67411"},"modified":"2026-10-07T11:31:39","modified_gmt":"2026-10-07T10:31:39","slug":"gp-internacional-de-atletismo-alberto-batista","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/gp-internacional-de-atletismo-alberto-batista\/","title":{"rendered":"GP Internacional de Atletismo Alberto Batista 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">GP Internacional de Atletismo Alberto Batista 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio Internacional de Atletismo Alberto Batista 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>10 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>17:00<\/strong>, no centro urbano de <strong>S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Organizado pelos <strong>Servi\u00e7os Sociais dos Trabalhadores do Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira<\/strong>, o evento homenageia a marcante figura desportiva de Alberto Batista, ex-atleta e prestigiado treinador do concelho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Tendo como epicentro o <strong>Mercado Municipal de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o oferece um circuito citadino r\u00e1pido e integralmente asfaltado, ideal para a obten\u00e7\u00e3o de recordes pessoais na dist\u00e2ncia de <strong>10 km<\/strong>. O programa desportivo contempla a prova rainha para Juniores, Seniores e Masters (escal\u00f5es Veteranos dos 35 aos 70 anos), antecedida a partir da tarde pelas <strong>Provas Jovens gratuitas<\/strong> de promo\u00e7\u00e3o do atletismo para Benjamins, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis, com abastecimentos, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica Lap2Go e entrega de trof\u00e9us.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira, Aveiro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Corrida de 10 km e Provas Jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapsho